                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>The dataset provides facts and figures about the trade between Batavia and China, by way of the South China Sea, in the period 1681-1792. It provides quantitative and qualitative information about ships and trading products. The dataset is the result of a project carried out at the Institute for the History of European Expansion (IGEER), Leiden University.</p>"
